	(text "reasoning: PDU or elcon will be prioritized over PD since it could be being used \nfor debugging. In those events, power from car or elcon is better. since PD is the\nlowest priority, it will be one its own input into the highest mux so the other input\nwill have higher priority. then, between PDU and ELCON that mux can prioritize PDU"
